    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "AGI Managed Cloud is in public alpha. "
        },
        {
          "text": "The support response commitments below are current policy. The uptime and credit numbers are planned targets, not a binding commitment, and they take effect only when a plan agreement says so.",
          "strong": true
        },
        {
          "text": " Local and BYOK modes have no AGI service in the request path, so there is nothing for us to commit to there. Reviewed 4 September 2026."
        }
      ]
